{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國堪薩斯州威奇托（Wichita）一個球場10月17日進行足球比賽期間，有汽車衝入，造成2人死亡（6歲男童及35歲男子），11人受傷（其中5人為兒童）。</p><p>警方表示，肇事的34歲女司機已被拘留，案件仍在調查中。</p><p>（CNN／新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:58:31.205802+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T08:03:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T18:37:38.133936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:57:32.388049+00:00","content_hash":"21a1972cd8f2c479aafa94fd07bc86caa7d3ed0014dc81d423a3bd0731690361","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}